"Buchung belegt keine Ausgabenfreigabe."
msgstr ""
"Reports distinguish bank balances, confirmed provider balances and unconfirmed "
"payments. Reserves, restrictions and unpaid commitments limit the available budget. "
"The second review is not a statutory audit. A transaction does not prove spending "
"approval."

#. Draft translation; native language and domain review pending.
