"total electricity price of the municipality minus billing fee of the network "
"operator. OpenLEG shows the sources and stores price and fee versioned. The LEG may "
"differ from the proposed range."

#. Draft checked against source; native language and domain review pending.
#: templates/release/how_it_works.html:22
